<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Don’t forget, don’t forget,</l><l>That the Lord is in you.</l><l>He’s not far like the stars,</l><l>No, He’s in you.</l><l>If you fall, just recall:</l><l>There’s a Person in you.</l><l>Then with His strength you will rise up anew.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
